# Never commit the paid paper downloads themselves (metadata JSON stays tracked):
research/Data-QuestionPapers-and-Memos-Downloaded/*
!research/Data-QuestionPapers-and-Memos-Downloaded/exclusions.json
!research/Data-QuestionPapers-and-Memos-Downloaded/catalog.json

# Documents — remote repo policy: text evidence only, never PDFs/Word:
*.pdf
*.docx

# Python bytecode from the OCR / measurement scripts:
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS junk:
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
